les its docstring describes.\n- **`fees.py:14`**: the late fee was `days_late + DAILY_FEE`; it's now `days_late * DAILY_FEE`.\n- **`inventory.py:24`**: `recent(n)` was returning one event too many. It now returns the last `n` events, or an empty list when `n` is 0 or less.\n\nThe first batch of edits to the other five files was rejected because the tool requires reading a file before editing it. I read each one, applied the edits again, and they worked.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": ["param:temperature"], "params_stripped_requests": 1, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 6, "replies_ok": null, "replies_throttled": null, "requests_cache_read": 118218, "requests_cache_write": 68336, "requests_cost_usd": 0.4366716, "requests_count": 9, "requests_input_uncached": 22, "requests_output": 3563, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "opencode:trig-read-lines:claude-opus-5-5:trial4", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 7, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-18T08:15:56.084753+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 47.97, "t_checker_s": 0.225, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-read-lines", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none", "none"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "vendor_split", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 3585, "tokens_cache_read": 118218, "tokens_cache_write": 68336, "tokens_fresh": 3567, "tokens_input_uncached": 22, "tokens_main_cache_read": 117191, "tokens_main_cache_write": 68336, "tokens_main_calls": 8, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 18, "tokens_main_output": 3549, "tokens_output": 3563, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 118218, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 68336, "tokens_proxy_calls": 9, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 22, "tokens_proxy_output": 3563, "tokens_proxy_r